    ["{{ Mr. | Ms. }}, you are the first person to bless me. I'm so happy!"] = "{{ Mr. | Ms. }}, ты первый, кто меня благословил. Я так счастлив!",
    ["Marionette essence formed after the death of a lost-of-control marionette in Utopia Theater, which can be used to purchase goods from the Essence Collector merchant."] = "Марионетка essence formed after the death of a lost-of-control Марионетка in Utopia Theater, which can be used to purchase goods from the Essence Collector merchant.",
